ges()`\r\n* Add `AssetServerSettings` to the prelude.\r\n* Minor cleanup.\r\n\r\n## Migration Guide\r\n`AssetServer::watch_for_changes()` was removed.\r\nInstead, use the `AssetServerSettings` resource.\r\n```rust\r\napp // AssetServerSettings must be inserted before adding the AssetPlugin or DefaultPlugins.\r\n\t.insert_resource(AssetServerSettings {\r\n\t\twatch_for_changes: true,\r\n\t\t..default()\r\n\t})\r\n```\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/5968/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/5968/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":7415071266,"node_id":"REFE_lADODf6-U85Rq156zwAAAAG5-QIi","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/events/7415071266","actor":{"login":"bors[bot]","id":26634292,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90MjY2MzQyOTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/bors","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"4f879ae81c6f06b1d2aeaebc5f35f61821ae9b69","commit_url":"https: